# ---- the compiled app is published as a Release asset, not committed ---------
# Keeping binaries out of history means the repo stays small and clonable, and
# every published build is traceable to a tagged commit.
DNotes.exe
DNotes.exe.config
*.zip

# ---- self-test scratch output -----------------------------------------------
# SELFTEST.txt at the repo root is deliberately NOT ignored: the README links to
# it as the report for the shipped build. These are the per-run dumps.
selftest-*.txt
selftest-*.png
demo-*.png
DNotes-selftest-*/

